            <ArticleTitle>[CT of Achilles tendons].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1287-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Until recently, direct imaging of the Achilles tendon has been proved difficult. CT scanning was performed in three patients with Achilles tendon pain. The authors find that CT scanning is of diagnostic value but further experience is required.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
